 ## Verified Now
 
-- What is currently working:
+- What is currently working: all three features in `feature_list.json` are `passing`.
+  - answer-feedback: every answer has a uuid `id`; `feedback.submit` / `feedback.list` work; ratings persist across restarts; both "Mark answer" buttons render per answer.
+  - reset-all-data: `app.reset()` clears documents, chunks, Q&A history and feedback; the "Reset all data" button asks for confirmation (Cancel keeps data); the empty state survives a restart.
+  - conversation-history: the right-hand panel shows the Q&A as a chat; each answer lists its sources (expand to the excerpt) and a color-coded confidence indicator; it survives reload and restart.
 - What verification actually ran:
+  - `bash init.sh` -> `init.sh OK` (type check, build, architecture, smoke-bridge).
+  - `npm test` -> 14 passed (`tests/feedback.test.ts`, `tests/reset.test.ts`, `tests/conversation.test.ts`).
+  - `node --experimental-websocket scripts/e2e-app.mjs <scenario> <dir>` for `feedback-ask`, `feedback-check`, `reset-populate`, `reset-verify`, `conversation-ask`, `conversation-check`: all E2E PASS against the real Electron app on macOS, sharing one user-data directory across launches.
 
 ## Changed This Session
 
 - Code or behavior added:
+  - Feedback: `QAResponse.id`, `FeedbackEntry`, `QaService.submitFeedback/getFeedback`, IPC `feedback:submit` and `feedback:list`, `AnswerFeedback` component.
+  - Reset: IPC `app:reset`, `window.knowledgeBase.app.reset()`, header button with inline confirmation.
+  - Conversation: `ConversationHistory` rewritten as a chat; `src/shared/confidence.ts`; history state moved into `App.tsx`. The "Show History" toggle was removed because the conversation is now the panel's content.
+  - Bug fix: `IndexingService.startIndexing(documentId)` now records chunks in `index-meta.json`. Before, documents indexed through the single-document path were never cited.
+  - Starting-state fix (its own commit `2d83a3b`): renderer import paths, unused imports, `File.path` typing, preload bundled with esbuild (`build:preload`), `.gitignore`.
+- Design choices to review:
+  - One rating per answer: resubmitting replaces the earlier rating and timestamp.
+  - `feedback.submit` rejects an `answerId` that is not in the history, and rejects ratings other than `up`/`down`.
+  - Legacy history entries without an id get one on read, and are written back.
+  - Reset uses an in-page confirmation (not `window.confirm`).
 - Infrastructure or harness changes:
+  - `vitest.config.ts` (scopes tests to `tests/`; `vite.config.ts` otherwise made vitest use the renderer root).
+  - `scripts/e2e-app.mjs`: CDP scenarios for the running app.
+  - `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`: feedback, reset and IPC table updated.
 
